 la Plata admite bicicletas de montaña y gravel. El albergue dispone de parking cubierto\npara bicicletas. La etapa El Carrascalejo–Caceres (34 km) es totalmente ciclable en menos de 3\nhoras.\u003C/p>",{"headings":48,"localImagePaths":49,"remoteImagePaths":50,"frontmatter":51,"imagePaths":52},[],[],[],{"id":32,"type":7,"name":33,"emoji":34,"category":35,"difficulty":38,"duration":39,"distance":36,"color":40,"order":41},[],"activities/fotografia-rural",{"id":53,"data":55,"body":65,"filePath":66,"digest":67,"rendered":68},{"id":56,"type":7,"name":57,"emoji":58,"category":59,"distance":60,"pilgrimMenu":12,"tags":61,"mustSee":12,"difficulty":14,"duration":62,"color":63,"order":64},"fotografia-rural","Fotografia Rural","📸","Cultura","Por el pueblo",[],"2 horas","#6d28d9",6,"El casco antiguo conserva arquitectura popular extremeña auténtica: corrales de piedra, portones de\nmadera y murales jacobeos. Las calles al atardecer tienen una luz especial para la fotografía.","src/content/local-guide/activities/fotografia-rural.md","2f8e107c48f1dec4",{"html":69,"metadata":70},"\u003Cp>El casco antiguo conserva arquitectura popular extremeña auténtica: corrales de piedra, portones de\nmadera y murales jacobeos. Las calles al atardecer tienen una luz especial para la fotografía.\u003C/p>",{"headings":71,"localImagePaths":72,"remoteImagePaths":73,"frontmatter":74,"imagePaths":75},[],[],[],{"id":56,"type":7,"name":57,"emoji":58,"category":59,"difficulty":14,"duration":62,"distance":60,"color":63,"order":64},[],"activities/observacion-aves",{"id":76,"data":78,"body":88,"filePath":89,"digest":90,"rendered":91},{"id":79,"type":7,"name":80,"emoji":81,"category":82,"distance":83,"pilgrimMenu":12,"tags":84,"mustSee":12,"difficulty":14,"duration":85,"color":86,"order":87},"observacion-aves","Observacion de Aves","🔭","Naturaleza","200 m al encinar",[],"1-4 horas","#0891b2",4,"Extremadura tiene la mayor densidad de aves rapaces de Europa. Desde el pueblo se avistan buitres\nleonados, cigüeñas blancas y negras, alimoches y milanos reales. Mejores horas: amanecer y\natardecer.","src/content/local-guide/activities/observacion-aves.md","9630fb6bb2891ebe",{"html":92,"metadata":93},"\u003Cp>Extremadura tiene la mayor densidad de aves rapaces de Europa. Desde el pueblo se avistan buitres\nleonados, cigüeñas blancas y negras, alimoches y milanos reales. Mejores horas: amanecer y\natardecer.\u003C/p>",{"headings":94,"localImagePaths":95,"remoteImagePaths":96,"frontmatter":97,"imagePaths":98},[],[],[],{"id":79,"type":7,"name":80,"emoji":81,"category":82,"difficulty":14,"duration":85,"distance":83,"color":86,"order":87},[],"activities/ruta-dehesa",{"id":99,"data":101,"body":111,"filePath":112,"digest":113,"rendered":114},{"id":102,"type":7,"name":103,"emoji":104,"category":105,"distance":106,"pilgrimMenu":12,"tags":107,"mustSee":12,"difficulty":14,"duration":108,"color":109,"order":110},"ruta-dehesa","Ruta de la Dehesa","🌳","Senderismo","8 km circular",[],"2-3 horas","#7c3aed",2,"Ruta circular por la dehesa boyal del municipio. Sin desnivel significativo, perfecta para el\ndescanso activo del peregrino. Se pasa junto a majadas de cerdos ibéricos y encinas centenarias.","src/content/local-guide/activities/ruta-dehesa.md","1d1f4d44743259d8",{"html":115,"metadata":116},"\u003Cp>Ruta circular por la dehesa boyal del municipio. Sin desnivel significativo, perfecta para el\ndescanso activo del peregrino. Se pasa junto a majadas de cerdos ibéricos y encinas centenarias.\u003C/p>",{"headings":117,"localImagePaths":118,"remoteImagePaths":119,"frontmatter":120,"imagePaths":121},[],[],[],{"id":102,"type":7,"name":103,"emoji":104,"category":105,"difficulty":14,"duration":108,"distance":106,"color":109,"order":110},[],"activities/via-plata-stage",{"id":122,"data":124,"body":133,"filePath":134,"digest":135,"rendered":136},{"id":125,"type":7,"name":126,"emoji":127,"category":105,"distance":128,"pilgrimMenu":12,"tags":129,"mustSee":12,"difficulty":38,"duration":130,"color":131,"